      "hierarchy_aware": "exhaustive search over the true model"
    },
    "scoring": "every plan is evaluated in the true (delegation-aware) model",
    "not_a_win_rate": "hierarchy_aware minimises the metric it is scored on and every rival plan is feasible for it, so it cannot lose; the reported quantities are the size of the modelling error, which is not structurally determined",
